{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_045kar01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_045kar01_title", "source_sha256": "af7ff34eaa08e8fc36bdb71f55d32ca6f371569d917b5696facc1ffbceb9d2a1", "ja": "可憐とおでかけ1", "zh": "和可怜外出1", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_045kar01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_045kar01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "39fe05bb19d5634a796018dc0eee6559dbdd3aca434477497870b5c0f67721dc", "ja": "可憐とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是与可怜一起外出时的片段。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_045kar01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_045kar01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "dc22b197c0e67077f5cd15e6f4bd54c856c3b667c3679ee79cbba6a92efea2f7", "ja": "（下関特産のフグのアピールに可憐が挑戦する！\n緊張しているみたいだけど、上手くやれるかな……）", "zh": "（这是可怜挑战宣传下关特产河豚的一幕！\n虽然她好像有些紧张，但能顺利完成吗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_045kar01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_045kar01_1001_045kar", "source_sha256": "35a4fb449a483cbb97bfd3bdce5a4f11d3dc79eb0937c7ed83cf78b0df2e39fa", "ja": "{$P$}さん、わ、私、昨日\nずっと考えてたんですけど……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，我、我昨天\n想了很久……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_045kar01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_045kar01_1002_045kar", "source_sha256": "31815580b37f32054a1c298610fca09c4dd62e6e2725314d072c3b46ee6374d1", "ja": "ふ、普通にPRしても、足を止めてくれる人は少ないと\n思うんです。私……じ、地味だから……。", "zh": "就、就算普通地做宣传，我觉得愿意停下脚步的人也不多。我……因、因为我太不起眼了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_045kar01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_045kar01_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "1fa57a52ed64995e09ae8f591d688380a3e12223d6d892198dd8dedbf2c644df", "ja": "このままじゃ、PRのお仕事ができないと思って、\n私……ふ、フグの被り物を、お借りしてきました……！", "zh": "我觉得再这样下去，就没法做宣传的工作了，所以……我、我借来了河豚头套……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_045kar01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_045kar01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "686468146843ad309767b2baa9d0a7e9f8fbe19f88608511537527d906bb876d", "ja": "えっ……こ、これは……。たしかに\nインパクトは抜群だが……。", "zh": "诶……这、这是……。确实\n冲击力十足……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_045kar01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_045kar01_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "16594210956b04ab5db497952e0c82c0d4c8137f4066b8de23e976390f0ecbc7", "ja": "こ、これなら、ちゃんとPRできますよね……？\nふふ、よかったぁ……♪", "zh": "这、这样的话，就能好好宣传了吧……？\n嘿嘿，太好了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_045kar01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_045kar01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "9ca16990e67a6336b7df14ba31b9564be5ff438010813c9f9b3e989e3799026c", "ja": "可憐……そんな、無理しなくてもいいんだぞ？", "zh": "可怜……不用那么勉强自己的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_045kar01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_045kar01_1007_045kar", "source_sha256": "281be7a32176cfbc8460caf592bb79bc46355cd20289081542706e172240f645", "ja": "む、無理なんて、してませんよ？\nとってもかわいいし……。", "zh": "我、我才没有勉强自己呢？\n而且特别可爱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_045kar01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_045kar01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "970b71aafb332684d9461f4db87312c1427f8ab87aea3294f475579885b0ed55", "ja": "そ、そうか。じゃあ、それで行こう！", "zh": "这、这样啊。那就按这个来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_045kar01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_045kar01_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "342b98c02b25c942722c329c0179a4fdbf2447eb2bd6cb832392ae4c998b79f7", "ja": "は、はい！　がんばります……！", "zh": "好、好的！我会努力的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_045kar01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_045kar01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "f46427c830c0df068bf50affc1f7df188b9f86697eb15d32cd5ce1b36b83cb41", "ja": "（可憐は時々、変なところで思い切りがいいな。でも、\nそんなところも魅力だから、アピールしていこう！）", "zh": "（可怜有时会在奇怪的地方果断得不得了啊。不过，这也是她的魅力，就把这一点也展现出来吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
